Play slowly, drink plenty of fluids, get plenty of rest.

I recommend levelporting into the left side of the sanctum rather than
slogging through the graveyard.

RISKY ADVICE FOLLOWS -- USE AT YOUR OWN RISK -- Another fun trick is
Zapping create monster until you get a cockatrice and use that to kill
Rodney, just be sure you have a wand of striking in your possession.
Also prepare the VS level with several living cockatrices and enter
the sanctum with the corpse of one in your possession.   NOTE: it
doesn't make the game so much easier that it is worth dying for, so
just stay in one place and let them move adjacent to you if they are
close, or else unwield the corpse and find the secret door.  Please
note: there is a spiked pit guaranteed on the level.  Do not move
while wielding the corpse.  In other words, while moving, do not wield
the corpse.  In fact, I'm not even sure that this is good advice ...

